# Routine "Daily spend check": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Each weekday morning, checks for a new export and speaks up only about groups over target or spending with nothing to show.
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/apple-search-ads-review && pi -p "/daily-spend-check"
